{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2661 Fear Comes From a Lack of Fetishes! \u2661</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/d52664312ddc028c6b11cd296ac5cfd2.poster.avif?t=1769155227\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/d52664312ddc028c6b11cd296ac5cfd2.webm?t=1769155227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/d52664312ddc028c6b11cd296ac5cfd2.mp4?t=1769155227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lazy exorcist apprentice who was expelled from your sect. Now, you wander around as a shameless conman, bluffing with your shallow knowledge of exorcism. But this time, you\u2019ve really messed up\u2014the abandoned hospital you were hired to cleanse is actually infested with female ghosts! These spirits, unable to pass on due to their lingering obsessions, each seem to be hiding their own mysterious secrets...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although your life may be at risk, you were planning to sneak away. But with the commission fee being far too tempting, you have no choice but to explore the hospital, uncover their weaknesses, and then\u2014\u201credeem\u201d them by sending them to ecstasy and release! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/ff5141d330d8e4bf569a8b12cc45c580.poster.avif?t=1769155227\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/ff5141d330d8e4bf569a8b12cc45c580.webm?t=1769155227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/ff5141d330d8e4bf569a8b12cc45c580.mp4?t=1769155227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2661 Exploration &amp; Investigation \u2661</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the reasons behind each ghost\u2019s lingering obsession. Learn their hidden, unspoken secrets. Perhaps beneath their terrifying appearance lies a soul longing to be understood and cared for.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/1840a269b908e176eb0af9f3ca7e5802.poster.avif?t=1769155227\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/1840a269b908e176eb0af9f3ca7e5802.webm?t=1769155227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/1840a269b908e176eb0af9f3ca7e5802.mp4?t=1769155227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2661 Battle With the Ghosts \u2661</strong><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use magic bullets and study the ghosts\u2019 attack patterns to counter them. In combat, weaken their negative energy, subdue them, and finally show them who\u2019s boss!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/0181c482e44c8fe956b1504a8b02804d.poster.avif?t=1769155227\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/0181c482e44c8fe956b1504a8b02804d.webm?t=1769155227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/0181c482e44c8fe956b1504a8b02804d.mp4?t=1769155227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u2661 Traps \u2661</strong><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take advantage of holy tools imbued with sacred power. Set clever traps tailored to each ghost\u2019s personality and desires. Once they fall into your snare, you\u2019ll be free to\u2026 do all sorts of naughty things with them\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/44d7783a58faf0c5a0cb84d86e8e4fca.poster.avif?t=1769155227\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/44d7783a58faf0c5a0cb84d86e8e4fca.webm?t=1769155227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/44d7783a58faf0c5a0cb84d86e8e4fca.mp4?t=1769155227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2661 The \u201cRedemption\u201d Ritual \u2661</strong><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghosts are embodiments of concentrated negative energy. The most effective way to heal them is from within. Once you\u2019ve broken their will to fight, step in as the exorcist to begin the \u201cRedemption\u201d ritual, curing them thoroughly from the inside out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/41e89186271b796a50f74e7949d5d49c.poster.avif?t=1769155227\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987800/extras/41e89186271b796a50f74e7949d5d49c.webm?t=1769155227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sou